cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived data, please cite the article below and this repository."
title: "Code and data for: Reporting-format change and the reliability of police at-fault flags"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline that assigns Montgomery County (Maryland) driver crash records to the legacy or the new
  (ACRS 2.0, 1 January 2024) reporting format, harmonises 12 coded fields, tests for label drift with
  interrupted time series, evaluates temporal transfer of gradient-boosted models, and estimates the
  sensitivity and false-flag rate of the police at-fault flag with a pair-count measurement model.
